  "text": "\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nKeokuk County, Iowa - County Government and Services\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n Skip to content\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n \n \n \n\n \n \n \n\n Search\n \n \n\n \n\n About \n \n\n Boards & Commissions\n Cemeteries\n Communities\n Elected Officials\n School Districts\n Township Information\n Opioid Settlement\n \n \n \n\n Departments \n \n\n Assessor\n Attorney\n Auditor\n Board of Supervisors\n Clerk of Court\n Conservation\n Emergency Management\n Engineer\n General Assistance\n Medical Examiner\n Public Health\n Recorder\n Sheriff\n Treasurer\n Veteran Affairs\n \n \n \n\n Resources \n \n \n\n Bid Notices\n Calendar\n Courts\n Economic Development\n Employment\n Frequently Asked Questions\n Landfill\n News\n Notifications\n \n \n \n\n Contact\n \n \n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n Search Keokuk County, Iowa\n \n\n \n \n \n\n \n \n \n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n \nKeokuk County, Iowa\n \n\n\n\n\n \n\n \n\n \n \n Conservation \n \n \n\n \n \n Elections \n \n \n\n \n \n Notifications \n \n \n\n \n \n Pay Property Taxes \n \n \n\n \n \n Real Estate Search \n \n \n\n \n \n Renew Vehicle Tags \n \n \n\n\n\n\n \n\n \n\n County Calendar\n \nMeetings + Events\n \n \nView All Meetings \n \n \n\n \n\n \nOctober 19, 2026\n Board of Supervisors Meeting\n 8:30 am\n Keokuk County Courthouse · \n \n\n \nBoard of Supervisors Meeting\n Keokuk County Courthouse\n 101 S. Main St.\n Sigourney, IA\n Map to Event\n \n\n October 19, 2026 \n 8:30 am \n\nThe Keokuk County Board of Supervisors typically meets on Monday mornings on the first floor of the Keokuk County Courthouse. \n Agenda \nPosted by: Board of Supervisors \n\n \n \n \n\n \nOctober 26, 2026\n Board of Supervisors Meeting\n 8:30 am\n Keokuk County Courthouse · \n\n \nBoard of Supervisors Meeting\n Keokuk County Courthouse\n 101 S. Main St.\n Sigourney, IA\n Map to Event\n \n\n October 26, 2026 \n 8:30 am \n\nThe Keokuk County Board of Supervisors typically meets on Monday mornings on the first floor of the Keokuk County Courthouse. \nPosted by: Board of Supervisors \n\n \n \n \n\n \nNovember 2, 2026\n Board of Supervisors Meeting\n 8:30 am\n Keokuk County Courthouse · \n\n \nBoard of Supervisors Meeting\n Keokuk County Courthouse\n 101 S. Main St.\n Sigourney, IA\n Map to Event\n \n\n November 2, 2026 \n 8:30 am \n\nThe Keokuk County Board of Supervisors typically meets on Monday mornings on the first floor of the Keokuk County Courthouse. \nPosted by: Board of Supervisors \n\n \n \n \n\n \nNovember 3, 2026\n General Election\n 7:00 am\n Sigourney, IA \n\n \nGeneral Election\n Sigourney, IA\n \n\n November 3, 2026 \n 7:00 am · 8:00pm \nPosted by: Auditor \n\n \n \n \n \n \n\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n Stay Informed\n \nRecent News\n All News\n\n\n\n\n \n\n \n \n\n\n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n Stay Informed\n \nRecent News\n All News\n \n \n\n \n \n 2026 General Election \n \n Posted October 14\n\n Read More \n \n \n \n\n \n \n Job Opening: Equipment Operator \n \n Posted October 13\n\n Read More \n \n \n \n\n \n \n Keokuk County Public Health Bringing “Public Health Pop-Ups” to Local Communities \n \n Posted August 28\n\n Read More \n \n \n \n\n \n \n Free Radon Test Kits for Rural Iowans! \n \n Posted August 26\n\n Read More \n \n \n \n\n \n \n Iowa HHS Issues Latest Measles Outbreak Information and Additional Exposure Location \n \n Posted August 25\n\n Read More \n \n \n \n\n \n \n Deer and Turkey Tags Go On Sale \n \n Posted August 11\n\n Read More \n \n \n \n\n \n \n Keokuk County Public Health Celebrates Iowa Moms and Babies this August During National Breastfeeding Month \n \n Posted August 7\n\n Read More \n \n \n \n\n \n \n Keokuk County Receives Opioid Settlement Funds to Support Prevention, Treatment, and Recovery \n \n Posted August 5\n\n Read More \n \n \n \n\n \n \n Certified copy fees increase on July 1 \n \n Posted June 2\n\n Read More \n \n \n \n\n \n \n Keokuk County Conservation Newsletter - Winter/Spring 2023 \n \n Posted December 21\n\n Read More \n \n \n \n\n \n \n Keokuk County Conservation Newsletter - Winter/Spring 2022 \n \n Posted December 21\n\n Read More \n \n \n \n\n \n \n Keokuk County Conservation Newsletter - Fall/Winter 2018-2019 \n \n Posted September 22\n\n Read More \n \n \n \n\n \n \n Keokuk County Conservation Newsletter - Winter 2017 \n \n Posted December 21\n\n Read More \n \n \n \n\n\n\n\n\n View All News \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n \nVisit Keokuk County\n \nBelva Deer\n \n\n \nVisitors can camp at Belva Deer Park, and visit one of our 7 parks, recreation areas, preserves, and river accesses managed by Keokuk County Conservation. \n \n \nOur Parks\n \n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n Learn About \n \n\nKeokuk County \n \n\nKeokuk County is a rural community of rich farmland, friendly people, and growing businesses. Located in the southeast quadrant of Iowa, Keokuk County was named after a famous Sac Indian Chief. The name means \"Watchful Fox\" or \"He Who Has Been Everywhere.\" Chief Keokuk advocated peace with the white settlers. In those days, Sac and Fox Indian tribes could be found roaming the area. \n \n\nRead More About Keokuk County \n \n \n\n \n \n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n \n\n Courthouse\n 101 S. Main\n \nSigourney, IA 52591 \n \n\n Office Hours\n Monday - Friday\n \n8:00 a.m. - 4:30 p.m.\n\n Department Hours May Vary\n \n \n\n Contact Us\n Closed Holidays \n \n\n\n\n\n \n\n \n© 2026 Keokuk County | Accessibility\n \npowered by \n \n\n\n\n\n\n \nUpcoming Holiday Closure Schedule\n \n \nVeteran's day (November 11, 2026)\n \nThanksgiving Day (November 26, 2026)\n \nDay after Thanksgiving (November 27, 2026)\n \nChristmas Day (December 25, 2026)\n \n\n\n"
